# Task 145-007: ADR-038 Self-Modifying Detector Runtime Wire

## Analysis
- `self-modifying-detector.ts` already has working implementation: `detectDeckentRepo()`, `isSelfModifying()`, `isSelfModifyingSprint()`
- DIRECTIVES expects aliases: `isDeckentRepository`, `isSelfModifyingScope`, `isSelfModifyingTask`
- sprint-controller.ts has NO import or usage of self-modifying detection
- emitNotify() in event-stream.ts takes (projectRoot, sprintId, level, title, body, meta?)

## Plan
1. Add alias exports to self-modifying-detector.ts: isDeckentRepository → detectDeckentRepo, isSelfModifyingScope, isSelfModifyingTask
2. Wire sprint-controller.ts PLAN phase: import + detect + emitNotify
3. Write comprehensive tests in tests/orchestra/self-modifying.test.ts (6+ tests)
4. Run tsc --noEmit + vitest
